+/*
+ * 0192/0193: the IPA's apps-SMMU streams (stock DT ipa_smmu_ap <0x520 0>, ipa_smmu_uc <0x522 0>; both banks S1 bypass there),
+ * each in its own SMR with the DT's exact mask, both to one free bank with translation off (as sweet_smmu_wlan_stream).
+ * 0192 boot: an SMR that reads back invalid can still refuse writes (SMR7 read 0 after the write, S2CR took it): owned
